\begin_layout Standard
Following this refinement,
 the merged climatic and fire dataset for all regions covers the period from January 1,
 2000,
 to December 31,
 2025.
 Specifically,
 Attica provides 2.100 forest fire records,
 Crete provides 2.893 wildfire record and finally Eastern Macedonia and Thrace provides 2.919 forest fire records.
\end_layout

