\begin_layout Standard
For the region of Eastern Macedonia and Thrace,
 the baseline period was (1992–2022) because climatological records for the region are not available prior to 1992,
 and the earliest data begin in 1992 rather than 1980,
 we adopted the 1992–2022 period as the 30 year baseline,
 in accordance with the WMO Technical Regulations on climatological normals.
